iler":false,"text":"自我と記憶を失っている無知な存在だが、それゆえに無垢で純粋。善と悪の区別さえ付かず、ただ言われたとおりのことをする操り人形だが……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「祈りを……。祈りをください。そうすればあなたたちは、救われます。わたしが救いますから……」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14534","sourceWorkId":"12975","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"天の女神を模して生み出された人造女神。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"太古に封じられた禁断の技術により、1人の少女に信仰を力に変換する機構を移植して生まれた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「正ノルニル教団」の新たな象徴 『現人神』として絶大な信仰を集めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自我と記憶を失っている無知な存在だが、それゆえに無垢で純粋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"善と悪の区別さえ付かず、ただ言われたとおりのことをする操り人形だが……。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"174740"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"77 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14534","sourceWorkId":"12975","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"153 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14534","sourceWorkId":"12975","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"79 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14534","sourceWorkId":"12975","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"52 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14534","sourceWorkId":"12975","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe099b373e7716a20166e6280c209f85e0edb4dfea4708e79b66f9663059d84c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cfb0f90a88cb69adebee4616c61a4eabc51344e8bffda661865ba1760b5c3cb5.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"坂田有希","creatorId":"vndb:s1595","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1595","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1595","name":"坂田 有希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:30096:174740:15687:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31629","characterName":"フェレス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"174741","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"30096"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14535"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31629"},"originalCharacterName":"フェレス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"夜の闇は、人々に心と身体を癒す安息の時を与え、死による闇で、あらゆる苦しみから生命を開放する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生と死、二つの異なる安息を司る異端の女神。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「異国の神」を名乗り、教皇アレクシスの前に現われ、人造神計画に協力し以降も「正ノルニル教団」に属する従属神としてその力を貸している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アイディリアを除いて唯一、力が衰えていない女神でもあるが、その理由は謎に包まれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「さぁ、世界に夜の帳を下ろしましょう。闇夜の静寂は、全ての命に等しく安らぎと休息を与えるのです」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14535","sourceWorkId":"12975","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"夜の闇は人々に心と身体を癒す安息の時を与え、死による闇であらゆる苦しみから生命を開放する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生と死、2つの異なる安息を司る異端の女神。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「異国の神」を名乗り、教皇・アレクシスの前に現われ人造神計画に協力し、以降も正ノルニル教団に属する従属神としてその力を貸している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アイディリアを除いて唯一力が衰えていない女神でもあるが、その理由は謎に包まれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ダンテスの率いる教団と根本的に相容れず、激しく敵対することになる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"174741"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14535","sourceWorkId":"12975","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"170 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14535","sourceWorkId":"12975","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14535","sourceWorkId":"12975","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14535","sourceWorkId":"12975","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/da0fdf5c6570d59857f563c9b180201c07e0549acb2bd4c843080796d3c6d1bd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/50ef98ef37654bcce8c64f4cec7ad0bc8cb02fb07cf8708411986634898ae32a.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅井晴美","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"浅井 晴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:30096:174741:6131:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c50415","characterName":"ダンテス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"174743","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"30096"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14537"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50415"},"originalCharacterName":"ダンテス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He was originally from a family that held high-ranking priesthood within the True Norn Church, but fell victim to a scheme by the current Pope Alexis, and was framed for a crime he did not commit, and his entire family was killed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He narrowly escaped execution, and on the run, his hatred for the church grew, he met Elide, the goddess of desire, and founded the \"Cult of Nemesia\" as a means of revenge."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When acting as the head of the cult, he wears a half-mask that was given powers by Elide, and he has come to be known as \"Dantès of the Angry Mask.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He will use any means to achieve his goals, and is shrewd and ruthless in all his actions. He is single-minded about his goal of revenge, and stoically pursues his goal."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c50415"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本編の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元は「正ノルニル教団」内でも高位の神官職を担う家系の出自だったが、現教皇アレクシスの謀略にあい、無実の罪を着せられた挙句に一族を皆殺しにされてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼は、かろうじて処刑を逃れ、教団への憎悪を募らせた逃避行の果てに、欲望の女神エリードと出会い、復讐のための手段として「ネメシア教」を興す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教団のトップとして行動する際にはエリードによって力を与えられた半仮面を装着しており、「怒る仮面のダンテス」と呼ばれるに至る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「復讐が何になる、だと？　何にもならんさ。ただ、今の俺に残された全てが、この計画だというだけだ」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14537","sourceWorkId":"12975","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元は正ノルニル教団内でも高位の神官職を担う家系の出自だったが、現教皇・アレクシスの謀略により無実の罪を着せられ、挙句に一族を皆殺しにされてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼はかろうじて処刑を逃れ、教団への憎悪を募らせた逃避行の果てに欲望の女神・エリードと出会い、復讐のための手段として「ネメシア教」を興す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教団のトップとして行動する際には エリードによって力を与えられた半仮面を装着しており、『怒る仮面のダンテス』と呼ばれるに至る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"目的のためには手段は選ばず、すべての行動を怜悧・冷酷にこなすことが出来る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"復讐という目的に真っ直ぐであり、 ただストイックに目的へ邁進する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"正ノルニル教団に属していた頃に女神・ルトナに対して情愛を抱いていたことを自ら認め、かつての羨望を情欲に変えて、彼女の身体を貪るように淫らなものへと変質させていく。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"174743"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c00e89b0d976b10d5c2da5886295b1a81068e375acafcf915b262955830ee32e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/90a19889a123a07637a7560220a3e7412c0bbd9c684e899d65f3350c70a493c8.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c50416","characterName":"アレクシス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"174742","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"30096"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14536"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50416"},"originalCharacterName":"アレクシス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"正ノルニル教団の現教皇。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"絶大な権力と指導力を背景に、教団を思うがままに動かす男。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"表向きは厳粛かつ公正な聖職者だが、その内には己が運命に対して狂った復讐心を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人造神を作りだして現人神として擁立し、現在の女神たちの力を徐々に弱体化させる原因を造った本人でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつてはダンテスの親友だったがある時期を境に、運命の歯車が狂い始めた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最も親しき友同士だったが故に、彼らの憎悪は、昏く、深い……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「知らなかったのかね？　この世は不平等だ。生まれも、貧富も、運命さえも。だから女神がいる。さあ、祈りたまえ。崇めたまえ。我らが擁する新しき女神……「黙す天空のアイディリア」を！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14536","sourceWorkId":"12975","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"正ノルニル教団の現教皇。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"絶大な権力と指導力を背景に、教団を思うがままに動かす男。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"表向きは厳粛かつ公正な聖職者だが、その内には己が運命に対して狂った復讐心を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人造神を作りだし現人神として擁立し、現在の女神たちを衰弱させる原因を造った本人でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつてはダンテスの親友だったが、ある時期を境に運命の歯車が狂い始めた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最も親しき友同士だったが故に、彼らの憎悪は昏く、深い……。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"174742"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a073bd6326b6e9189fd0c577a9e2d8eb73e2bdf4cdde7820c66806e3537c77eb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/ee19eacc690620d8fba9ad56f9f11c9eb44b39e0fc5abe7f0aae53c88cc5971e.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c31617","characterName":"ルトナ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c31617"},"originalCharacterName":"ルトナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"revie